      <p>Rhiannon Louve is a writer of science fiction, fantasy, urban fantasy, and steampunk fiction, as well as contemporary Pagan thea/ology and table top role-playing games. She is co-founder of the SpiralWorks service organization, and holds an MA in Applied Theology. In addition, Rhiannon does vocals, keyboards, and some songwriting for the geek metal band, Megatherium.</p>
